2026-11-12 18:46:36,640 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - **Alternative explanation**: Normal business cloud service usage
2026-11-12 18:46:36,640 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] **2. Critical Investigation Limitations Documented:**
2026-11-12 18:46:36,640 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] - Filesystem extraction (run_fls) failed, blocking access to:
